{
  "title": "PushNPull",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Creative sidechain",
        "effects for dummies.",
        "",
        "A curve repeats in",
        "time with the beat",
        "and ducks or boosts",
        "the volume, sweeps a",
        "filter, or both.",
        "",
        "Tempo-sync only: it",
        "is bypassed while",
        "the transport is",
        "stopped."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Curve page",
      "lines": [
        "Rate: how often the",
        " curve repeats",
        " (1/8 to 1/1).",
        "Vol: volume depth.",
        "Filter: cutoff depth.",
        " 0% = off.",
        " Below 0 ducks,",
        " above 0 boosts.",
        "",
        "The picture is one",
        "cycle of the curve.",
        "The dotted line is",
        "where the beat is.",
        "",
        "Curve: 12 shapes.",
        "Slope: how wide the",
        " dip or rise is.",
        "Shift: slides it",
        " earlier or later.",
        "Attack: eases the",
        " start. Depth stays."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Filter page",
      "lines": [
        "Model: SVF or",
        " Schwoog (ladder).",
        "Drive: saturation",
        " before the filter.",
        "Cutoff, Reso: the",
        " filter the curve",
        " sweeps around.",
        "Mode: LP HP BP Notch",
        " Peak AP (SVF only).",
        "",
        "The filter only runs",
        "when Filter depth on",
        "the Curve page is",
        "not 0%."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Output page",
      "lines": [
        "Split: duck only the",
        " lows, leave the",
        " highs untouched.",
        "Xover: where lows",
        " end (20 Hz-5 kHz).",
        "Output: final level."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
